/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (MadDog\072\040A\040Web\055based\040System\040for\040Acronym\040Identification\040and\040Disambiguation)
/Author (Amir\040Pouran\040Ben\040Veyseh\054\040Franck\040Dernoncourt\054\040Walter\040Chang\054\040Thien\040Huu\040Nguyen)
/Subject (Acronyms\040and\040abbreviations\040are\040the\040short\055form\040of\040longer\040phrases\040and\040they\040are\040ubiquitously\040employed\040in\040various\040types\040of\040writing\056\040Despite\040their\040usefulness\040to\040save\040space\040in\040writing\040and\040reader\220s\040time\040in\040reading\054\040they\040also\040provide\040challenges\040for\040understanding\040the\040text\040especially\040if\040the\040acronym\040is\040not\040defined\040in\040the\040text\040or\040if\040it\040is\040used\040far\040from\040its\040definition\040in\040long\040texts\056\040To\040alleviate\040this\040issue\054\040there\040are\040considerable\040efforts\040both\040from\040the\040research\040community\040and\040software\040developers\040to\040build\040systems\040for\040identifying\040acronyms\040and\040finding\040their\040correct\040meanings\040in\040the\040text\056\040However\054\040none\040of\040the\040existing\040works\040provide\040a\040unified\040solution\040capable\040of\040processing\040acronyms\040in\040various\040domains\040and\040to\040be\040publicly\040available\056\040Thus\054\040we\040provide\040the\040first\040web\055based\040acronym\040identification\040and\040disambiguation\040system\040which\040can\040process\040acronyms\040from\040various\040domains\040including\040scientific\054\040biomedical\054\040and\040general\040domains\056\040The\040web\055based\040system\040is\040publicly\040available\040at\040http\072\057\057iq\056cs\056uoregon\056edu\0725000\040and\040a\040demo\040video\040is\040available\040at\040https\072\057\057youtu\056be\057IkSh7LqI42M\056\040The\040system\040source\040code\040is\040also\040available\040at\040https\072\057\057github\056com\057amirveyseh\057MadDog\056)
